{"route":"/hop/wiki/perks","title":"Perks - House of Pips Wiki","description":"Every perk and malus in House of Pips with icons, rarities and exact rules.","html":"<h1>Perks</h1>\n<p>Perks are the cards you draft during a match. Each one bends the rules of the table for the rest of that match: extra points, peeks at hidden bones, swaps, wild plays and more. Maluses are the red cards that bend the rules against you. Every perk below links to a page with its exact behaviour, how copies stack and a worked example where the maths matters.</p>\n<p class=\"legend\"><span class=\"pill rarity-common\">Common</span> <span class=\"pill rarity-uncommon\">Uncommon</span> <span class=\"pill rarity-rare\">Rare</span> <span class=\"pill rarity-epic\">Epic</span> <span class=\"pill rarity-legendary\">Legendary</span> <span class=\"pill rarity-malus\">Malus</span> </p>\n<p>Some quick rules that apply to every perk:</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Copies stack.</strong> Drafting the same perk twice usually doubles its effect or its uses. Each perk page says exactly how its copies combine.</li><li><strong>A scoring play</strong> is any play after which the open ends add up to a positive multiple of five. Bonus perks only add points to scoring plays; they never turn a non-scoring play into one. See <a href=\"/hop/wiki/scoring\">Scoring in depth</a> for the order in which bonuses, multipliers and maluses are applied.</li><li><strong>Uses refill every hand.</strong> Perks with limited uses (marked <em>Uses</em> on their page) get them back at the start of each hand. The card text says \"per round\"; a round and a hand are the same thing.</li><li><strong>Perks last for the match.</strong> Everything you draft is gone when the match ends. Unlocking a perk in the Perks compendium only adds it to the cards drafts can offer you.</li><li><strong>Rival drafts the same cards.</strong> A perk in Rival's hands has the same effect it would have for you.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"filters\" data-filter-root=\"perk-list\"><span class=\"filter-label\">Rarity</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" data-filter=\"rarity\" data-value=\"\" aria-pressed=\"true\">All</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip rarity-common\" data-filter=\"rarity\" data-value=\"common\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Common</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip rarity-uncommon\" data-filter=\"rarity\" data-value=\"uncommon\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Uncommon</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip rarity-rare\" data-filter=\"rarity\" data-value=\"rare\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Rare</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip rarity-epic\" data-filter=\"rarity\" data-value=\"epic\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Epic</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip rarity-legendary\" data-filter=\"rarity\" data-value=\"legendary\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Legendary</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip rarity-malus\" data-filter=\"rarity\" data-value=\"malus\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Malus</button><span class=\"filter-label\">Type</span><select data-filter=\"kind\" aria-label=\"Filter by type\"><option value=\"\">Any type</option><option value=\"Active ability\">Active ability</option><option value=\"Boneyard\">Boneyard</option><option value=\"Boneyard penalty\">Boneyard penalty</option><option value=\"Draft\">Draft</option><option value=\"Hand award\">Hand award</option><option value=\"Hand award penalty\">Hand award penalty</option><option value=\"Information\">Information</option><option value=\"Malus protection\">Malus protection</option><option value=\"Placement\">Placement</option><option value=\"Placement penalty\">Placement penalty</option><option value=\"Score multiplier\">Score multiplier</option><option value=\"Scoring bonus\">Scoring bonus</option><option value=\"Scoring penalty\">Scoring penalty</option><option value=\"Turn\">Turn</option><option value=\"Turn penalty\">Turn penalty</option></select><input type=\"search\" data-filter=\"text\" placeholder=\"Filter by name or text\" aria-label=\"Filter perks by text\"></div>\n<div id=\"perk-list\"><section class=\"perk-group\" data-group=\"common\"><h2 id=\"common\">Common perks (10)</h2><ul class=\"perk-grid\"><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-common\" data-rarity=\"common\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"doubles\" data-text=\"double trouble on a scoring play, a double adds 5 points.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/doubles\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/doubles-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Double Trouble</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">On a scoring play, a double adds 5 points.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-common\" data-rarity=\"common\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"blank\" data-text=\"zero hero on a scoring play, a bone containing a blank adds 5 points.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/blank\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/blank-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Zero Hero</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">On a scoring play, a bone containing a blank adds 5 points.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-common\" data-rarity=\"common\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"draw\" data-text=\"lucky pocket a scoring play made immediately after drawing adds 5 points.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/draw\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/draw-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Lucky Pocket</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">A scoring play made immediately after drawing adds 5 points.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-common\" data-rarity=\"common\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"lowball\" data-text=\"low rider on a scoring play, a bone with 3 total pips or fewer adds 5 points.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/lowball\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/lowball-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Low Rider</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">On a scoring play, a bone with 3 total pips or fewer adds 5 points.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-common\" data-rarity=\"common\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"odd_job\" data-text=\"odd job on a scoring play, a bone with an odd pip total adds 5 points.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/odd_job\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/odd_job-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Odd Job</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">On a scoring play, a bone with an odd pip total adds 5 points.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-common\" data-rarity=\"common\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"even_flow\" data-text=\"even flow on a scoring play, a bone with an even pip total adds 5 points.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/even_flow\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/even_flow-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Even Flow</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">On a scoring play, a bone with an even pip total adds 5 points.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-common\" data-rarity=\"common\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"first_blood\" data-text=\"first blood your first scoring play of each round adds 5 points.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/first_blood\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/first_blood-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">First Blood</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Your first scoring play of each round adds 5 points.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-common\" data-rarity=\"common\" data-kind=\"Hand award\" data-id=\"soft_landing\" data-text=\"soft landing your remaining hand awards rival 5 fewer points.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/soft_landing\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/soft_landing-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Soft Landing</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Hand award</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Your remaining hand awards Rival 5 fewer points.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-common\" data-rarity=\"common\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"five_alive\" data-text=\"five alive a scoring play with an open-end total of exactly 5 adds another 5 points.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/five_alive\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/five_alive-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Five Alive</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">A scoring play with an open-end total of exactly 5 adds another 5 points.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-common\" data-rarity=\"common\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"insurance\" data-text=\"round insurance after losing a hand, your first scoring play next hand adds 5 points per stack.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/insurance\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/insurance-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Round Insurance</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">After losing a hand, your first scoring play next hand adds 5 points per stack.</span></a></li></ul></section><section class=\"perk-group\" data-group=\"uncommon\"><h2 id=\"uncommon\">Uncommon perks (9)</h2><ul class=\"perk-grid\"><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-uncommon\" data-rarity=\"uncommon\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"chain\" data-text=\"hot streak a scoring play that is your second or later consecutive play without visiting the boneyard adds 5 points.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/chain\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/chain-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Hot Streak</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">A scoring play that is your second or later consecutive play without visiting the boneyard adds 5 points.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-uncommon\" data-rarity=\"uncommon\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"underdog\" data-text=\"comeback kid a scoring play made while you are behind adds 5 points.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/underdog\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/underdog-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Comeback Kid</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">A scoring play made while you are behind adds 5 points.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-uncommon\" data-rarity=\"uncommon\" data-kind=\"Information\" data-id=\"boneyard_peek\" data-text=\"boneyard lantern every time you go to the boneyard, one fixed face-down bone is revealed.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/boneyard_peek\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/boneyard_peek-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Boneyard Lantern</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Information</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Every time you go to the boneyard, one fixed face-down bone is revealed.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-uncommon\" data-rarity=\"uncommon\" data-kind=\"Boneyard\" data-id=\"light_fingers\" data-text=\"light fingers once per round, draw two bones and keep the one with fewer pips.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/light_fingers\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/light_fingers-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Light Fingers</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Boneyard</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Once per round, draw two bones and keep the one with fewer pips.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-uncommon\" data-rarity=\"uncommon\" data-kind=\"Malus protection\" data-id=\"shield\" data-text=\"pip shield whenever a malus lowers a scoring play, restore up to 5 points per stack.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/shield\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/shield-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Pip Shield</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Malus protection</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Whenever a malus lowers a scoring play, restore up to 5 points per stack.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-uncommon\" data-rarity=\"uncommon\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"branch_bank\" data-text=\"branch bank a scoring play on a vertical branch adds 5 points.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/branch_bank\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/branch_bank-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Branch Bank</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">A scoring play on a vertical branch adds 5 points.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-uncommon\" data-rarity=\"uncommon\" data-kind=\"Active ability\" data-id=\"swap_stock\" data-text=\"bone trader once per round, choose one of your bones and one face-down boneyard bone to swap.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/swap_stock\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/swap_stock-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Bone Trader</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Active ability</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Once per round, choose one of your bones and one face-down boneyard bone to swap.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-uncommon\" data-rarity=\"uncommon\" data-kind=\"Boneyard\" data-id=\"salvage\" data-text=\"salvager once per round, replace a drawn bone worth at least 10 pips.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/salvage\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/salvage-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Salvager</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Boneyard</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Once per round, replace a drawn bone worth at least 10 pips.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-uncommon\" data-rarity=\"uncommon\" data-kind=\"Active ability\" data-id=\"open_book\" data-text=\"open book once per hand, reveal one hidden bone of your choice to reveal a random hidden rival bone. both racks need at least three bones; revealed bones stay public while held.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/open_book\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/open_book-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Open Book</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Active ability</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Once per hand, reveal one hidden bone of your choice to reveal a random hidden rival bone. Both racks need at least three bones; revealed bones stay public while held.</span></a></li></ul></section><section class=\"perk-group\" data-group=\"rare\"><h2 id=\"rare\">Rare perks (10)</h2><ul class=\"perk-grid\"><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-rare\" data-rarity=\"rare\" data-kind=\"Boneyard\" data-id=\"catch_and_release\" data-text=\"catch and release once per hand, after an ordinary unplayable draw, return that bone face-up to its original boneyard position and end your turn. no replacement draw.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/catch_and_release\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/catch_and_release-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Catch and Release</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Boneyard</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Once per hand, after an ordinary unplayable draw, return that bone face-up to its original boneyard position and end your turn. No replacement draw.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-rare\" data-rarity=\"rare\" data-kind=\"Active ability\" data-id=\"pip_shift\" data-text=\"pip shift once per hand per stack, drag one pip across a bone&#x27;s divider. values stay within 0–6. the shifted bone becomes public and must be played this turn.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/pip_shift\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/pip_shift-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Pip Shift</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Active ability</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Once per hand per stack, drag one pip across a bone&#x27;s divider. Values stay within 0–6. The shifted bone becomes public and must be played this turn.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-rare\" data-rarity=\"rare\" data-kind=\"Active ability\" data-id=\"swap_rival\" data-text=\"table thief once per round, choose one of your bones and one face-down rival bone to swap blindly.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/swap_rival\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/swap_rival-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Table Thief</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Active ability</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Once per round, choose one of your bones and one face-down rival bone to swap blindly.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-rare\" data-rarity=\"rare\" data-kind=\"Active ability\" data-id=\"pip_nudge\" data-text=\"loaded end once per round, arm a one-pip-away placement, preview its +1 or -1 change, and spend the charge only when played.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/pip_nudge\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/pip_nudge-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Loaded End</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Active ability</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Once per round, arm a one-pip-away placement, preview its +1 or -1 change, and spend the charge only when played.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-rare\" data-rarity=\"rare\" data-kind=\"Placement\" data-id=\"counterfeit\" data-text=\"counterfeit pip once per round, arm one blank as a wildcard, preview its wild placement, and spend the charge only when played.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/counterfeit\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/counterfeit-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Counterfeit Pip</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Placement</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Once per round, arm one blank as a wildcard, preview its wild placement, and spend the charge only when played.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-rare\" data-rarity=\"rare\" data-kind=\"Draft\" data-id=\"reroll\" data-text=\"fresh cut once per draft per stack, upgrade the lower-rarity perk offer by one rarity tier.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/reroll\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/reroll-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Fresh Cut</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Draft</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Once per draft per stack, upgrade the lower-rarity perk offer by one rarity tier.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-rare\" data-rarity=\"rare\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"jackpot\" data-text=\"jackpot ends a scoring play with an open-end total of at least 25 adds 20 points.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/jackpot\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/jackpot-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Jackpot Ends</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">A scoring play with an open-end total of at least 25 adds 20 points.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-rare\" data-rarity=\"rare\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"collector\" data-text=\"collector on a scoring play, each distinct double you have played this round adds 2 points.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/collector\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/collector-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Collector</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">On a scoring play, each distinct double you have played this round adds 2 points.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-rare\" data-rarity=\"rare\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"royal_flush\" data-text=\"royal train a scoring play with the 6-6 bone adds 30 points.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/royal_flush\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/royal_flush-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Royal Train</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">A scoring play with the 6-6 bone adds 30 points.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-rare\" data-rarity=\"rare\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"domino_effect\" data-text=\"domino effect each consecutive scoring play adds 5 more points than the previous scoring play.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/domino_effect\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/domino_effect-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Domino Effect</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Each consecutive scoring play adds 5 more points than the previous scoring play.</span></a></li></ul></section><section class=\"perk-group\" data-group=\"epic\"><h2 id=\"epic\">Epic perks (10)</h2><ul class=\"perk-grid\"><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-epic\" data-rarity=\"epic\" data-kind=\"Hand award\" data-id=\"fortress\" data-text=\"bone fortress your remaining hand can award rival no more than 10 points.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/fortress\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/fortress-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Bone Fortress</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Hand award</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Your remaining hand can award Rival no more than 10 points.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-epic\" data-rarity=\"epic\" data-kind=\"Hand award\" data-id=\"close\" data-text=\"clean finish going domino doubles the opposing hand award.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/close\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/close-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Clean Finish</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Hand award</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Going domino doubles the opposing hand award.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-epic\" data-rarity=\"epic\" data-kind=\"Score multiplier\" data-id=\"golden_double\" data-text=\"golden double a scoring play with a double doubles the entire play.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/golden_double\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/golden_double-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Golden Double</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Score multiplier</span><span class=\"tile-text\">A scoring play with a double doubles the entire play.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-epic\" data-rarity=\"epic\" data-kind=\"Placement\" data-id=\"wild_blank\" data-text=\"wild blank your blanks may match any open end.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/wild_blank\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/wild_blank-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Wild Blank</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Placement</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Your blanks may match any open end.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-epic\" data-rarity=\"epic\" data-kind=\"Active ability\" data-id=\"alchemy\" data-text=\"pip alchemy once per round, choose a bone and change each value to its double-six complement.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/alchemy\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/alchemy-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Pip Alchemy</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Active ability</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Once per round, choose a bone and change each value to its double-six complement.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-epic\" data-rarity=\"epic\" data-kind=\"Active ability\" data-id=\"pip_shuffle\" data-text=\"pip shuffle once per hand, drag any number of pips across a bone&#x27;s divider. values stay within 0–6. the shuffled bone becomes public and must be played this turn.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/pip_shuffle\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/pip_shuffle-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Pip Shuffle</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Active ability</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Once per hand, drag any number of pips across a bone&#x27;s divider. Values stay within 0–6. The shuffled bone becomes public and must be played this turn.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-epic\" data-rarity=\"epic\" data-kind=\"Boneyard\" data-id=\"dead_mans_draw\" data-text=\"dead man&#x27;s draw with one bone left, draw one extra face-down candidate per stack, reveal them, and choose what to keep.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/dead_mans_draw\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/dead_mans_draw-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Dead Man&#x27;s Draw</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Boneyard</span><span class=\"tile-text\">With one bone left, draw one extra face-down candidate per stack, reveal them, and choose what to keep.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-epic\" data-rarity=\"epic\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"echo\" data-text=\"echo chamber on a scoring play, repeat your previous perk bonus.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/echo\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/echo-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Echo Chamber</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">On a scoring play, repeat your previous perk bonus.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-epic\" data-rarity=\"epic\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"momentum\" data-text=\"runaway train every third consecutive play made without drawing adds 15 points if it is a scoring play.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/momentum\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/momentum-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Runaway Train</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Every third consecutive play made without drawing adds 15 points if it is a scoring play.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-epic\" data-rarity=\"epic\" data-kind=\"Scoring bonus\" data-id=\"long_count\" data-text=\"the long charge each non-scoring play banks a charge. your next scoring play with an open-end total of 5 gains 5 points per charge.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/long_count\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/long_count-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">The Long Charge</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Scoring bonus</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Each non-scoring play banks a charge. Your next scoring play with an open-end total of 5 gains 5 points per charge.</span></a></li></ul></section><section class=\"perk-group\" data-group=\"legendary\"><h2 id=\"legendary\">Legendary perks (11)</h2><ul class=\"perk-grid\"><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-legendary\" data-rarity=\"legendary\" data-kind=\"Information\" data-id=\"read\" data-text=\"the tell rival&#x27;s playable bones glow while remaining face-down.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/read\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/read-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">The Tell</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Information</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Rival&#x27;s playable bones glow while remaining face-down.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-legendary\" data-rarity=\"legendary\" data-kind=\"Hand award\" data-id=\"immunity\" data-text=\"untouchable hand your remaining pips can never score for rival.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/immunity\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/immunity-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Untouchable Hand</span><span clas