 them and choose what to keep.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/sovereign_draw\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/sovereign_draw-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Sovereign Draw</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Boneyard</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Every boneyard visit draws one extra face-down candidate per stack; reveal them and choose what to keep.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-legendary\" data-rarity=\"legendary\" data-kind=\"Information\" data-id=\"table_whisperer\" data-text=\"table whisperer play locations reveal whether they expand or restrict rival&#x27;s legal options.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/table_whisperer\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/table_whisperer-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Table Whisperer</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Information</span><span class=\"tile-text\">Play locations reveal whether they expand or restrict Rival&#x27;s legal options.</span></a></li><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-legendary\" data-rarity=\"legendary\" data-kind=\"Information\" data-id=\"final_warning\" data-text=\"final warning when rival holds one bone, the safest legal play location is marked.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/final_warning\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/final_warning-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Final Warning</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Information</span><span class=\"tile-text\">When Rival holds one bone, the safest legal play location is marked.</span></a></li></ul></section><section class=\"perk-group\" data-group=\"malus\"><h2 id=\"malus\">Malus (9)</h2><ul class=\"perk-grid\"><li class=\"perk-tile rarity-malus\" data-rarity=\"malus\" data-kind=\"Hand award penalty\" data-id=\"heavy_hand\" data-text=\"heavy hand rival gains 5 extra points from your remaining hand.\"><a href=\"/hop/wiki/perks/heavy_hand\"><img src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/heavy_hand