 src=\"hop/wiki-data/img/perks/stumble-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tile-name\">Stumble</span><span class=\"tile-kind\">Turn penalty</span><span class=\"tile-text\">After scoring, you must draw on your next turn whenever possible.</span></a></li></ul></section></div><p class=\"muted\" id=\"perk-empty\" hidden>No perk matches those filters.</p>","toc":[]}